<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen continue to attack civilian targets, exemplified by a student bus shooting and a school bus assault in Sinaloa, while federal forces seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. The United States is expanding its involvement, offering drone forensics tools, seeking a role in anti-cartel operations, and pressuring Mexico for a security win ahead of the midterm elections. Mexican authorities also arrested five individuals in Oaxaca linked to loan extortion and drug networks with ties to the Sinaloa Cartel. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EIN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPTXY1emlKb3VqSmVyNE5ocHpBemFSaU4ybnpYdkh0ek5FWVE4QnU5UlMyVmRreTBLVUQxbG9FVEhDczI3cU5YZV9mN29qaDFPVERaQ0FDOXZraDVSeE9pVEhOZWRkTzhfazF1SUtLMVhhWnRBY1R0VTEweHdUblo4RkZ2TGZkY1ct?oc=5&quot;&gt;Puerto Vallarta News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KATU&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOWFowRG40dXpiaXRoYUU0QklSN0I3U2V2UHJEalBDXzJ1T2RfSzdFVlFzTHB6UHZkNEVPRlRONFdjWEVyTGxnbTJrc1BfQVVBdkU0WlRsRG5WVHRmRzFKMWNyQWZ2QkRsVENFR00wbGFVd0MtVE1QejVNOERUSF9NbzFfSjVjWTFmdndReTFFNFVpaFQyQ1paSVlNS2x2d0FmS1M4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Washington Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNSTQ4TFhxMkJrRXhxYjhJMm9jNFpTd0ZjdkZWM2VYTVJ0VmlDNU93ajlCZXdEUVpPOGNnYW9INE5ZMGdYMHBK